    "advancement": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 17th level, you can use your action and spend 2 energy points to shroud the vision of a creature within 30 feet of you. The creature must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have everything, except you, become heavily obscured for 1 minute.</p><p>At the end of each of its turns, the target can make another Wisdom saving throw, ending the shadowy duel on a successful saving throw.</p>",
